Today, we're expanding our eighth-generation TPU portfolio with two new systems built specifically for the agentic era — bringing our total to four distinct eighth-generation TPU systems launched in a single year.

TPU 8i Max was built for massive context windows and the highest compute density per rack, and TPU 8tx is optimized for secure and confidential inference. While flexible across workloads, the four systems in our 8th gen TPU portfolio give developers and organizations a purpose-built accelerator for every stage of the agentic lifecycle.

@AminVahdat, SVP and Chief Technologist, AI and Infrastructure, explains why we're expanding our TPU portfolio and what everyone needs to know about TPU 8tx and 8i Max ⬇️
